{"id": "DfTYcikS1i5", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Maa Parvati ne Shani Dev ko shraap diya tha. Par kyun, jabki unhone khud kaha tha ki mere bete ko dekhiye?\n\nShani Dev ko pehle se shraap tha ki woh jis cheez ko dekhenge, woh nasht ho jayegi. Isiliye woh sar jhuka kar rehte the. Unhone Maa ko yeh baat bata bhi di, par Maa hans padin aur boli, dekhiye mujhe aur mere bete ko.\n\nMata ki aagya thi, toh Shani Dev ne Dharma ko gawah banaya, aur baayi aankh ke kone se sirf baalak ko dekha. Usi ek nazar se baalak ka sar alag ho gaya.\n\nMaa Parvati ne phir kya shraap diya, Part 3 mein.\n\nPart 2 of 3. Sources pinned comment mein hain.\n\nAap Shani Dev ki jagah hote toh kya karte? 👇\n\n#shanidev #shani #ganesh #hindumythology #sanatandharma", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793760103, "like_count": 59692, "comment_count": 227, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-29998603839726390a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 56.696, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOn9jFPhOdnhjeY-muLUGiSQn-tMgm-mGpf7Hwkvn0oc0bgQEbkYm3Iss1_sbKPdBnqAyPwqVvVo7iePQHtBlmdncLEKftcr4Xh_BI.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdoloBXD5ibDbZJ-U5afNFmqiIZ1feFeqCSOVLS2hUHUuwOF5ZUil9ZRKMhZjhL4xjWs0ywvoSMIwX8hAFiB87f5&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=htG4iMJScEwQ7kNvwFMed0h&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=jfyWMw7cQa6ZhY7taT3cnA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQistWlxmCIVrtWdjFHTnknsIXGA3xbUE_lFTSgU0MEiQ&oe=6AF42A4E", "manifest_stream_nu